{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Change_the_Specimen}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \fs24 Change the Specimen
\par \pard \plain\fs20 
\par After the specimen chamber is brought to atmospheric pressure it can be opened:
