\par \pard\li445\fi-275\tx445 \b \{bmc bm19.shg\}\tab \plain\fs20 Open the chamber door
\par \{bmc bm20.shg\}\tab Remove the specimen
\par \{bmc bm21.shg\}\tab Change the Stage spacer
\par \{bmc bm22.shg\}\tab Put in a new specimen
\par \{bmc bm23.shg\}\tab Close the chamber door
\par 
\par \{bmc bm24.shg\}\tab Go back
\par 
\par While at air do you want to:
\par \uldb Change the anode spacer\plain\fs20 {\v 1KHCK3U@operation.hlp}
\par \b 
\par \uldb \plain\uldb\fs20 Change the filament\plain\fs20 {\v 2MRA_.K@operation.hlp}
\par \pard\tx445 
\par \pard\tx445 
