\pard\keepn {\up K}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up K} Annotate the Image}
\b\fs24 Display Control Panel\plain\fs36 
\par \pard \fs20 The control panel provides a summary of the SEM Control settings.
\par \fs24 
\par \b\fs20 Follow these steps:
\par \plain\fs20 
\par \pard\li445\fi-275\tx445 \{bmc bm5.bmp\}\tab Type \b <Ctrl + G> \plain\fs20 
\par 
\par \{bmc bm24.shg\}\tab Go back
